WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,060
Do you know what to prepare?

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,180
Don't know much

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,580
Although the Xiaolanshan training base is called a base

4
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,380
But it is a pure and natural outdoor environment

5
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,180
In addition to the necessary supplies in the base

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,580
Outside of medical and other infrastructure

7
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,780
there is nothing there

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,380
So after getting there

9
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,380
You will live a life of sleeping in the open air

10
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,980
You need to prepare everything you need to survive in the wild

11
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,580
Am I going to stay there for a month?

12
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,180
Of course it would be best if you could stay for a month

13
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,380
But from my experience

14
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,780
You can stay there for ten days and a half

15
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,780
It’s already amazing. Why?

16
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,780
Don’t underestimate the four words “feng dian” and “sleeping in the open”

17
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,650
For those of you who grew up

18
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,250
For children who grew up in the city

19
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,250
Life in the wild is not that easy

20
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:35,850
As far as I know

21
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,250
I asked students to go to Xiaolanshan base for training

22
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:40,650
The longest record of staying there is eighteen days

23
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,450
If you can break this record

24
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,850
The base will give you a grand prize

25
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,480
Dining and sleeping outdoors

26
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,280
Xuanwu is comfortable and spacious

27
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,880
The space inside a living person’s body that can live in

28
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,480
Surviving in the wild is like taking a vacation

29
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,280
This is the big prize for me

30
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,680
Basically no suspense
